{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Settings"]]},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE11defaultSizeyQr0A7Spatial6Size3DVF::SYNTHESIZED::s:11OpenSwiftUI8SettingsV","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultSize"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial6Size3DV","text":"Size3D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","text":"Scene"}],"extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","role":"symbol","title":"defaultSize(_:)","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Settings\/defaultSize(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultSize","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"size","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Size3D","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial6Size3DV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default size for new windows created from a scene."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"size"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"text":"Return Value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene that uses a default size for new windows."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this scene modifier to indicate a default initial size for a new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"window that the system creates from a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" declaration. For"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"example, you can request that new windows that a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"generates occupy 600 points in the x-dimension and 400 points in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the y-dimension:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["@main","struct MyApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            ContentView()","        }","        .defaultSize(CGSize(width: 600, height: 400))","    }","}"],"syntax":null},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The size that you specify acts only as a default for when the window"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first appears. People can later resize the window using interface"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"controls that the system provides. Also, during state restoration,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the system restores windows to their most recent size rather than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the default size."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you specify a default size that’s outside the range of the window’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"inherent resizability in one or both dimensions, the system clamps the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"affected dimension to keep it in range. You can configure the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resizability of a scene using the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene\/windowResizability(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"modifier."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default size modifier affects any scene type that creates windows"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in Windows, namely:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Window"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"DocumentGroup","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Settings"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you want to specify the input directly in terms of width and height,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"code":"Scene\/defaultSize(width:height:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" instead.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/settings\/defaultsize(_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets a default size for a window."}],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documen